      "message": "[warning] Line 246: 🟡 `setUpdatedConversations` is called before readiness/permission-confirmed dispatch. When dispatch is rejected (for example grants changed after selection), the share extension still marks the conversation as updated and keeps the copied temp file, creating false-positive UI refreshes and avoidable storage buildup. Move `setUpdatedConversations` to only run after `sendSwarmFile(...) \u003d\u003d true`, and remove `destinationURL` on all post-copy failure paths.",
